1
00:00:02,163 --> 00:00:04,103
(Penny:)Hey, so I saw a movie trailer
the other day.

2
00:00:04,155 --> 00:00:06,515
(Penny:)How could Batman
possibly fight Superman?

3
00:00:06,514 --> 00:00:08,044
(Penny:)I mean, isn't that dumb?

4
00:00:08,048 --> 00:00:09,348
(Bernadette:)Maybe he uses Kryptonite.

5
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:11,350
(Emily:)Well, Batman's got
a lot of money.

6
00:00:11,352 --> 00:00:14,322
(Emily:)Maybe he builds a suit that can
do everything Superman can do.

7
00:00:14,321 --> 00:00:15,651
(Penny:)No, no, no, no, no.

8
00:00:15,656 --> 00:00:17,586
(Penny:)I've seen that movie.
It's called Iron Man.

9
00:00:25,032 --> 00:00:27,162
(quietly):
What is happening?

10
00:00:27,168 --> 00:00:29,668
(Howard:)I don't know.

11
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:32,170
(Raj:)But it's beautiful.

12
00:00:33,707 --> 00:00:35,277
(Penny:)And now Ben Affleck
is Batman?

13
00:00:35,276 --> 00:00:37,476
(Emily:)Oh, he was great in
Shakespeare in Love.

14
00:00:37,478 --> 00:00:39,478
(Penny:)Ooh, we should watch that
next girls' night.

15
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:40,680
(Bernadette:)We could do a double feature

16
00:00:40,681 --> 00:00:42,251
with the Leonardo DiCaprio
Romeo + Juliet.

17
00:00:42,249 --> 00:00:44,019
(Penny:)Oh, I love me some Leo.

18
00:00:44,018 --> 00:00:45,688
(Leonard:)And it's gone.

19
00:00:46,754 --> 00:00:48,624
(Sheldon:)Oh, hello, everyone.

20
00:00:48,622 --> 00:00:51,562
(Sheldon:)I am happy to report
I'm feeling much better.

21
00:00:51,559 --> 00:00:52,959
(Leonard:)Good for you.

22
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,160
(muttering)

23
00:00:54,161 --> 00:00:56,961
(Sheldon:)My fever is gone,
my sinuses are pressure-free,

24
00:00:56,964 --> 00:01:01,024
(Sheldon:)and my mucus is as clear
as a Yosemite waterfall.

